{"seq":3,"slug":"new-harmonic-language","title":"新和声语言与非功能体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/modern-harmony/new-harmonic-language","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"新和声语言与非功能体系\">新和声语言与非功能体系</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>20 世纪以来，作曲家逐渐放弃功能和声的&quot;紧张-解决&quot;叙事，转而为和弦寻找新的组织逻辑。理解这些体系的关键是把握它们各自的&quot;去功能&quot;策略：印象派用平行与全音阶让和弦成为纯色彩并置；四度/五度叠置与对称结构从音程构造上模糊大小调；Neo-Riemannian 变换用声部最小运动替代根音关系来解释连接。它们并不推翻功能，而是提供了功能无法解释的连接的另一套语言。后文印象派、叠置结构、Neo-Riemannian 与当代实践都沿此展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超越功能和声的动机\">超越功能和声的动机</h2><p>从 19 世纪末开始，作曲家们逐渐感到功能和声的&quot;紧张-解决&quot;模式已不足以表达新的情感与思想。Wagner 的《Tristan und Isolde》（1865）前奏曲中的&quot;特里斯坦和弦&quot;被视为调性瓦解的起点——一个永远不解决的属七变体和弦，暗示着无尽的渴望。</p>\n<p>20 世纪的和声探索沿着多条路径展开：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;传统功能和声&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Wagner/Strauss&lt;br/&gt;半音化极端&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Debussy&lt;br/&gt;印象派和声&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Schoenberg&lt;br/&gt;无调性→十二音&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Stravinsky&lt;br/&gt;复调性/新古典&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;全音阶/平行和弦&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;序列主义&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;多调性叠加&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"传统功能和声\"] --&gt; B[\"Wagner/Strauss&lt;br/&gt;半音化极端\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Debussy&lt;br/&gt;印象派和声\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Schoenberg&lt;br/&gt;无调性→十二音\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Stravinsky&lt;br/&gt;复调性/新古典\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"全音阶/平行和弦\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"序列主义\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"多调性叠加\"]</pre><h2 id=\"印象派和声语言\">印象派和声语言</h2><p>Claude Debussy 开创的印象派和声拒绝了功能进行的&quot;叙事逻辑&quot;，转而追求和弦作为<strong>纯色彩</strong>的并置。核心技法包括：</p>\n<p><strong>平行和弦运动</strong>（Planing）：相同结构的和弦做平行位移，忽略调内音级约束。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cmaj \\to Dmaj \\to Emaj \\to F\\sharp maj</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>所有和弦都是大三和弦，平行上行。这在传统和声中&quot;违规&quot;（产生大量平行五八度），但在印象派中恰恰是其标志性色彩。</p>\n<p><strong>全音阶和声</strong>：基于全音音阶（六个等距全音）的和弦，消除了半音的倾向性。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>全音阶：</mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{全音阶：} C - D - E - F\\sharp - G\\sharp - A\\sharp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全音阶：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>附加音和弦的解放</strong>：九度、十一度不再需要&quot;解决&quot;，它们成为和弦色彩的常驻成员。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>印象派技法</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>传统禁忌</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平行和弦</td>\n<td>色块并置</td>\n<td>平行五八度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全音阶</td>\n<td>方向模糊</td>\n<td>无主音/导音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未解决延伸</td>\n<td>色彩丰富</td>\n<td>非和弦音必须解决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>踏板 drone</td>\n<td>时间悬停</td>\n<td>和弦需要运动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"四度叠置与对称结构\">四度叠置与对称结构</h2><p>传统和弦基于三度叠置，但 20 世纪作曲家探索了其他叠置方式：</p>\n<p><strong>四度和弦</strong>（Quartal Harmony）：以纯四度为间距叠置。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C - F - B\\flat - E\\flat</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>四度和弦既非大调也非小调，具有&quot;开放&quot;&quot;现代&quot;的音响。McCoy Tyner 在 Miles Davis 五重奏后的个人风格中将四度和弦发展为爵士钢琴的标志性 voicing。</p>\n<p><strong>五度和弦</strong>：以纯五度叠置，是四度和弦的转位。产生更加空旷的效果。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C - G - D - A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>对称结构</strong>：基于等分八度的和弦构造。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>减七和弦：</mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>小三度等分</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{减七和弦：} C - E\\flat - G\\flat - A \\quad (\\text{小三度等分})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">减七和弦：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小三度等分</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>增三和弦：</mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>大三度等分</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{增三和弦：} C - E - G\\sharp \\quad (\\text{大三度等分})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增三和弦：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大三度等分</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>全音阶和声：</mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>全音等分</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{全音阶和声：} C - D - E - F\\sharp \\quad (\\text{全音等分})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全音阶和声：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全音等分</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 叠置方式对比&#10;        A[&quot;三度叠置&lt;br/&gt;传统和弦&lt;br/&gt;大小调色彩明确&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;四度叠置&lt;br/&gt;现代开放&lt;br/&gt;调性模糊&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;对称叠置&lt;br/&gt;等分八度&lt;br/&gt;方向不确定&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 叠置方式对比\n        A[\"三度叠置&lt;br/&gt;传统和弦&lt;br/&gt;大小调色彩明确\"]\n        B[\"四度叠置&lt;br/&gt;现代开放&lt;br/&gt;调性模糊\"]\n        C[\"对称叠置&lt;br/&gt;等分八度&lt;br/&gt;方向不确定\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"neo-riemannian-变换\">Neo-Riemannian 变换</h2><p>Neo-Riemannian 理论是 20 世纪末发展的一种分析非功能和声的工具。它不再以&quot;根音五度关系&quot;来理解和弦连接，而是关注<strong>声部最小运动</strong>——两个和弦之间，声部移动的半音数越少，连接越&quot;亲近&quot;。</p>\n<p>三种基本变换（均只移动一个音，半音距离）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变换</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>C 示例</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P (Parallel)</td>\n<td>大↔小 (三音半音移动)</td>\n<td>C→Cm</td>\n<td>三音 E→E♭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R (Relative)</td>\n<td>大→关系小 / 小→关系大</td>\n<td>C→Am</td>\n<td>五音 G→A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L (Leading-tone)</td>\n<td>大：根音下半音 / 小：五音上半音</td>\n<td>C→Em</td>\n<td>根音 C→B</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>通过 P、R、L 的组合可以到达任何三和弦。这套系统揭示了 19 世纪浪漫派音乐中许多&quot;难以用功能解释&quot;的和弦进行的内在逻辑——声部导向逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mi>P</mi></mpadded></mover><mi>C</mi><mi>m</mi><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mi>R</mi></mpadded></mover><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mi>P</mi></mpadded></mover><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mi>m</mi><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mi>L</mi></mpadded></mover><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\xrightarrow{P} Cm \\xrightarrow{R} E\\flat \\xrightarrow{P} E\\flat m \\xrightarrow{L} B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每一步只有一个声部移动一个半音，但和弦从 C 大三到达了距离遥远的 B 大三。</p>\n<h2 id=\"当代作曲中的新和声实践\">当代作曲中的新和声实践</h2><p>2020 年代的作曲实践中，以下新和声语言获得了广泛关注：</p>\n<p><strong>光谱音乐</strong>（Spectral Music）：以泛音列分析为基础构建和弦。Grisey、Murail 等法国作曲家开创的流派，和弦来源于对具体声音的频谱分析结果。</p>\n<p><strong>微分音和声</strong>：超越十二平均律的和声探索。72等分律、31等分律等系统提供了全新的音程资源。Jacob Collier 在获得格莱美的编曲中使用微分音和声引起了主流关注。</p>\n<p><strong>算法和声</strong>：通过数学规则或概率模型生成和弦进行。Brian Eno 的生成音乐（Generative Music）理念在 2025 年与 AI 结合后产生了全新的创作范式。</p>\n<p><strong>声部导向 + AI</strong>：2024-2025 年，OpenAI、Google DeepMind 的音乐模型开始展现出对 Neo-Riemannian 式声部导向逻辑的&quot;自发学习&quot;——模型在训练后倾向于生成声部平滑移动的和声进行，即使未被显式教授这些规则。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>新和声方向</th>\n<th>核心理念</th>\n<th>代表人物</th>\n<th>时代</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光谱音乐</td>\n<td>泛音列 → 和弦</td>\n<td>Grisey, Murail</td>\n<td>1970s-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微分音</td>\n<td>突破12平均律</td>\n<td>Collier, Sevish</td>\n<td>2010s-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算法/生成</td>\n<td>规则/概率驱动</td>\n<td>Eno, Xenakis</td>\n<td>1960s-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 和声</td>\n<td>神经网络生成</td>\n<td>MusicLM, Suno</td>\n<td>2023-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>特里斯坦和弦象征调性瓦解，20 世纪和声沿多条路径展开。</li>\n<li>印象派以平行和弦、全音阶、未解决延伸音追求纯色彩并置。</li>\n<li>四度/五度叠置与对称结构从构造上模糊大小调、模糊方向。</li>\n<li>Neo-Riemannian 变换（P/R/L）以声部最小运动解释非功能和声连接。</li>\n<li>当代新和声实践：光谱音乐、微分音、算法/生成、AI 声部导向。</li>\n<li>这些体系并非否定功能，而是补充了功能无法解释的连接语言。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>非功能体系是对功能和声的超越，需先掌握被超越的对象：<a href=\"../chord-progressions/functional-harmony\">功能和声与进行模型</a></li>\n<li>四度叠置、全音阶等与爵士的 Quartal voicing 同源：<a href=\"jazz-harmony\">爵士和声体系</a></li>\n<li>光谱音乐&quot;从频谱构建和弦&quot;直接依赖傅里叶分析：<a href=\"../../audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis/fft-fundamentals\">频谱分析基础</a></li>\n<li>AI 和声模型如何把和声序列 token 化并生成，见生成模型：<a href=\"../../ai-music-generation/generative-models/transformer-music\">Transformer 音乐生成</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"新和声语言与非功能体系","id":"新和声语言与非功能体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"超越功能和声的动机","id":"超越功能和声的动机"},{"level":2,"text":"印象派和声语言","id":"印象派和声语言"},{"level":2,"text":"四度叠置与对称结构","id":"四度叠置与对称结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Neo-Riemannian 变换","id":"neo-riemannian-变换"},{"level":2,"text":"当代作曲中的新和声实践","id":"当代作曲中的新和声实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"调式互换与借用和弦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/modern-harmony/modal-interchange"},"next":null}